Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:02.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So today's video is gonna be fairly unusual.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.77,0:00:08.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You may be wondering to yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.22,0:00:10.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,why the hell is this in the bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.17,0:00:12.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Kon-Melo, it's ya Tech Wizardess girl, MeloriTensei!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.12,0:00:14.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And this right here, lads,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.98,0:00:20.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,is my old MacBook Air Mid-2011 Edition, 11 inch.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.75,0:00:21.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So you might be wondering to yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.87,0:00:24.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,why the hell is this in the bag?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.02,0:00:27.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Well, your first guess might be, "oh the battery is leaking".
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.33,0:00:29.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, that was not the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.68,0:00:31.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Surprising enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.12,0:00:35.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Sure, the battery has degraded down to like 20%.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.60,0:00:39.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Like it barely fucking runs, it runs for like probably
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.75,0:00:43.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,a couple of minutes and then it just dies.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.80,0:00:45.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But no, that was not the case.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.77,0:00:48.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So what actually happened is,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.28,0:00:51.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,well if I pull it out, I'm gonna make a mess on this table,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.20,0:00:53.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,but you will see what I mean by then.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.43,0:00:57.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if you guys can see this, but if I zoom it in,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.67,0:01:01.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,there's a little bit of aluminium oxide corrosion happening.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.63,0:01:04.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure what I'm saying is correct.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.42,0:01:08.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So please correct me on the comments below if I'm wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.70,0:01:11.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But there's a little bit of, umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.27,0:01:14.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,wouldn't say rusting because it's not quite rusting.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.53,0:01:17.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It's not brown, it's flaking white all over the place.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.47,0:01:19.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And it has been wreaking havoc
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.33,0:01:22.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,in my storage for literal years.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.53,0:01:23.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And umm,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.78,0:01:28.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,while this MacBook technically still runs, it has made crazy mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.88,0:01:30.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta put this back inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.55,0:01:31.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,This is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.95,0:01:35.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Let's flip this baby over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.17,0:01:36.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh fuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.32,0:01:38.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I got one on the table!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.25,0:01:39.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.57,0:01:41.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh well, we're gonna clean that up later.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.78,0:01:43.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So you might be wondering to yourself,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.47,0:01:48.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,why the hell did Mel bought a MacBook Air in 2011?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.78,0:01:51.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that was actually not my choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.17,0:01:54.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So the reason I had the MacBook
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.03,0:01:56.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,was because if you've seen the iPod video,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.70,0:01:59.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,you would understand that ever since I got this iPod,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.73,0:02:03.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I've actually been quite fascinated about Apple products for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.80,0:02:07.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And as a surprise gift, Papa Mel and Mama Mel
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.28,0:02:10.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,bought me this MacBook as my new personal computer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.45,0:02:14.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So I don't have to hog the family PC the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.13,0:02:15.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I gotta be honest,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.73,0:02:18.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,that's actually the funniest story, personally,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.18,0:02:19.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,about how the hell I got this Mac.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.82,0:02:23.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I was definitely the talk around the school for a brief moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.03,0:02:26.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But otherwise, it has been a pretty good daily driver, I would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.92,0:02:30.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Like, it lets me do virtually anything like surfing the internet,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.82,0:02:32.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,do word processing and all that stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.97,0:02:37.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Surprising enough, despite this thing running second gen i5,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.20,0:02:39.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and it only has 4 gigs of RAM,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.05,0:02:41.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,it somehow did Roblox for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.52,0:02:42.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1410,598)}Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.37,0:02:44.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It ran Roblox!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.15,0:02:46.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I know y'all in the comments,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.15,0:02:49.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,do not type/post whatever you have against Roblox.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.97,0:02:52.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, I understand what happened in Roblox,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.97,0:02:54.65,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,but the past was the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.65,0:02:57.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, Lil kid Mel didn't know much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.33,0:02:59.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But, that whole shmoo aside, um,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.88,0:03:03.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,but I played my entire childhoods of old Roblox games
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.87,0:03:06.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,on this Mac the whole time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.07,0:03:09.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, for y'all OGs who played Roblox ages ago,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.12,0:03:10.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,tell me if you remember these titles.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.10,0:03:14.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Base Wars, Survive the Disasters, Underground War,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.55,0:03:19.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Two Player War Tycoon, Sandbox, Built to Survive Zombies?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.83,0:03:20.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:22.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And the Tower of Zombies, I think?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.52,0:03:24.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I don't quite remember the title anymore,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.53,0:03:26.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's called "Zombie Tower"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.17,0:03:27.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,but I'm sure Editor Mel would put it on the top here,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.00,0:03:29.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,or on the side, or wherever the heck it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.67,0:03:29.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Editor Mel: You got it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.67,0:03:34.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,If you remember at least 75% of all the games I've talked about,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.07,0:03:35.53,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,you are one heck of an OG.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.93,0:03:37.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So yeah, um, as gaming,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.73,0:03:39.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I've actually played a lot of Roblox on this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.85,0:03:41.65,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And, um, aside from Roblox,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.65,0:03:44.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I did play my first ever Steam game,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.20,0:03:46.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,which was Team Fortress 2.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.35,0:03:47.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Surprising enough,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.47,0:03:49.92,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,the reason why I was playing Team Fortress 2 around then
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.92,0:03:51.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,is because I was looking on YouTube
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.42,0:03:52.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,looking for a great game to play,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.82,0:03:56.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and coincidentally, the recommendations algorithm around then,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.43,0:03:58.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,well, albeit not sophisticated,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.45,0:04:01.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,recommended me Team Fortress 2 free-to-play.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.48,0:04:02.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You know that trailer, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.58,0:04:04.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,If y'all play TF2 then...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.38,0:04:04.95,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(753,353)}Team Fortress 2 is Free to Play
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.15,0:04:05.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1482,622)}Hehehe~
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.02,0:04:07.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So I've installed TF2 on Steam on Mac.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.88,0:04:08.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's terrible,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.82,0:04:10.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,but at the time, Little Mel didn't know much.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.75,0:04:12.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um, I had a lot of fun!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.47,0:04:14.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I was playing as Sniper at the start,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.97,0:04:17.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and as time progresses,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.02,0:04:18.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I started trying out all the other classes,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.98,0:04:24.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and I found myself enjoying Engineer, Soldier, Medic,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.50,0:04:26.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,maybe occasionally Spy,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.20,0:04:28.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and Heavy, obviously, and obviously Pyro.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.22,0:04:30.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, everyone's crazy awesome, I gotta be honest.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.90,0:04:32.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,However, you might be wondering,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.37,0:04:34.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,why don't I play TF2 anymore recently?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.78,0:04:36.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That's because there isn't demand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.32,0:04:38.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,If there is demand, I would totally play it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.70,0:04:39.33,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,In a heartbeat.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.33,0:04:41.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But obviously, there will be a lot of planning involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.35,0:04:42.72,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We probably need to,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.72,0:04:45.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,well, not say full stack, but one party at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.38,0:04:46.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.23,0:04:48.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But otherwise, I'm down to playing TF2.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.42,0:04:51.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So yeah, aside from TF2, I've actually played...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.38,0:04:52.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hmm... What other games have I played?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.90,0:04:53.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I've played...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.57,0:04:55.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh god, there's this game.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.22,0:04:57.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,There's this game that currently don't quite exist anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.93,0:04:59.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It's called UberStrike.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.52,0:05:02.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And umm, that game's kind of like a fast-paced FPS.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.48,0:05:03.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.30,0:05:03.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Spread?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.87,0:05:04.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,What spread?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.63,0:05:05.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1440,602)}Hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.37,0:05:07.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Bullet spread don't quite exist in that game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.20,0:05:07.45,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1404.8,972.6)}Credit: tay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.45,0:05:09.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And um, I was basically nailing...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.85,0:05:10.65,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1323.2,972.6)}Credit: BlackEagle
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.48,0:05:10.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Nailing headshots and um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.93,0:05:11.65,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1492,632)}(ahem)
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.65,0:05:12.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Dare I say...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.62,0:05:14.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Nut shots O///O
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.62,0:05:14.08,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1323.2,972.6)}Credit: BlackEagle
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.08,0:05:15.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,on enemies in that game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.50,0:05:18.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And I gotta be honest, totally a childhood game.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.32,0:05:19.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And you might be wondering,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.08,0:05:22.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,how the hell did I discover that kind of obscure game?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.15,0:05:24.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Well, for one, it was around the time
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.43,0:05:25.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,where Facebook game was a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.98,0:05:27.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But secondly, I've discovered
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.42,0:05:29.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,this game through the Mac App Store.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.82,0:05:30.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.68,0:05:32.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Mac App Store of all places.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.28,0:05:33.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1502,616)}Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.27,0:05:36.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But the Mac client was actually really, really good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.47,0:05:37.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Really well done.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.23,0:05:38.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And um...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.10,0:05:40.65,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It gets me into the game really quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.65,0:05:41.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,No frills.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.45,0:05:43.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Just straight into the action.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.10,0:05:44.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And off the action after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.30,0:05:47.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Totally a game that I would play if TF2 doesn't load at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.50,0:05:48.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\ytshake\an5\pos(1466,574)}Hehe.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.42,0:05:50.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And there was a small period of time
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.25,0:05:51.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I've actually played Unturned.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.93,0:05:54.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But Unturned was like freaking...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.30,0:05:57.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,15 frames or like, I don't know, 10 frames.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.18,0:05:59.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know how the hell Little Mel dealt with that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.57,0:06:01.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And then I did play a bit of Minecraft after that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.95,0:06:05.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Minecraft 1.7.2 probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.60,0:06:06.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Sometime around then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.62,0:06:07.82,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe nowhere past 10.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.82,0:06:08.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Just 7.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.48,0:06:09.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Just 7 and 5.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.62,0:06:10.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Because at that time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.68,0:06:13.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,there was a lot of mods for those two versions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.23,0:06:15.17,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Y'all OGs, you might remember that version.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.17,0:06:16.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1472,618)}Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.00,0:06:18.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But yeah, aside from gaming, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.20,0:06:19.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,How does it do as a Mac?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.90,0:06:21.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um, well...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.22,0:06:23.03,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Unlike today's walled garden,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.03,0:06:26.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,the walled garden back then wasn't as enticing to me, I would say.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.60,0:06:30.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I pretty much lived the life of mostly cross-platform
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.88,0:06:32.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,on many, many smaller things.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.87,0:06:36.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Like say, I still enjoy watching videos on VLC.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.28,0:06:38.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure VLC existed around then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.47,0:06:39.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I might be a little wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.28,0:06:39.88,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1276.8,831.8)}She was right, existed
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.88,0:06:41.42,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,If VLC didn't exist, I might...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.42,0:06:43.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I must be using QuickTime then.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.32,0:06:44.08,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But well, screw that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.08,0:06:48.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Um, I've learned how to record videos using ScreenFlow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.37,0:06:49.90,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But ScreenFlow was...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.90,0:06:51.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I say it performs really well,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:53.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,but it has a massive watermark.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.62,0:06:55.57,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1243.2,913.4)}Example
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.73,0:06:55.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Like, the watermark is huge.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.67,0:06:58.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Lil Kid me thought, "I'm gonna buy ScreenFlow Pro
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.85,0:07:00.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,so I can get rid of the watermark."
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.40,0:07:01.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That never happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.47,0:07:02.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You wanna know why?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.38,0:07:05.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Because I went to Windows and discovered OBS.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.83,0:07:07.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1522,596)}Hehehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.28,0:07:08.47,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.47,0:07:10.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That aside, as a very portable laptop,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.63,0:07:12.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,like this crazy light,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.35,0:07:15.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I am never going back to a heavy laptop life.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.60,0:07:18.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Except I did due to financial reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.77,0:07:19.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1494,572)}Hehehe
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.60,0:07:22.25,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That laptop you saw on the CachyOS video,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.25,0:07:24.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,that's currently my daily driving laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.22,0:07:27.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And it currently still runs CachyOS as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.38,0:07:30.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And throughout the whole time that I was gone,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.35,0:07:32.13,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(771.2,220)}(Temporary stream hiatus for restructuring content\Nin December [and forward if not done by then])
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.12,0:07:32.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I was actually using CachyOS.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.18,0:07:34.10,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And I was daily driving CachyOS.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.10,0:07:36.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,If you wanna know more about my opinions on CachyOS
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.67,0:07:39.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and how it actually feels, maybe a review on the OS,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.23,0:07:41.85,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,let me know in the comments below.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.85,0:07:45.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So I know you guys wanna hear more about CachyOS from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.77,0:07:47.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Because I'm actually kind of looking forward to make that video,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.77,0:07:49.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,but I don't know if there's a demand for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.48,0:07:51.93,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But that aside, at some point, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.93,0:07:56.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,MacOS got discontinued for this MacBook on High Sierra.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.68,0:07:59.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And I was really into Mojave.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.55,0:08:02.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Like, the visual change and stuff, having dark mode.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:04.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,There was so many cool stuff coming out of Mojave.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.88,0:08:07.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't know why,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.05,0:08:09.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I've started learning how to Hackintosh since then.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.95,0:08:11.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,However, it goes without saying,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.07,0:08:13.15,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I don't endorse Hackintoshing,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.15,0:08:14.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,for you know what reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.20,0:08:15.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1590,558)}(ahem)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.15,0:08:15.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}* For legal reasons (ahem)
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.58,0:08:19.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,However, I have tried bootcamping to Windows.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.32,0:08:21.65,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And Windows 10...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.65,0:08:23.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh god, Microslop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.20,0:08:24.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.57,0:08:26.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I've stopped using Windows pretty quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.70,0:08:30.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And I've switched to using Ubuntu Linux.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.05,0:08:34.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And Ubuntu was actually my entry into the Linux world.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.07,0:08:35.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Can you believe that?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.13,0:08:37.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I've kept using Ubuntu for a very, very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.45,0:08:39.67,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I've never really left Ubuntu.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.67,0:08:41.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Never switched out of any other OS.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.63,0:08:44.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Probably a brief moment I've tried Vanilla OS,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.37,0:08:46.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,but it never really worked out on the Mac.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.88,0:08:49.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, I've kind of switched to putting it on the laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:51.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,The CacheOS laptop instead.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.37,0:08:53.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But I've never stuck around on Vanilla OS.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.43,0:08:57.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't like using immutable operating systems all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.70,0:08:58.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of more of a
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.87,0:09:01.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,"sometimes I would use it" type kind of person.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.83,0:09:04.30,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But not daily driving immutable OS.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.30,0:09:05.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But that aside, umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.43,0:09:08.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,this thing ran Ubuntu for a very, very, very, very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.88,0:09:12.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,All the way up to Ubuntu 24 even.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.13,0:09:15.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, it kind of ran for pretty, pretty damn long.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.77,0:09:19.68,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And up to a certain point, it started flaking aluminiums.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.68,0:09:22.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And, um... Boy oh boy, it smells!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.57,0:09:26.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, it doesn't really stank hard like stinky tofu.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.63,0:09:28.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But you can totally smell it
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.32,0:09:29.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,if you run it through a vacuum.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.78,0:09:32.87,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And the vacuum filters had some of those flakes
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.87,0:09:34.73,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,remaining inside its filters.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.73,0:09:36.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,You can totally smell it from the outlet.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.97,0:09:37.55,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Just...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:37.55,0:09:39.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Oh gosh.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.35,0:09:40.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So yeah, um...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.60,0:09:42.23,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Now with this contained in the bag,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.23,0:09:44.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,you might be wondering where the hell I'm gonna take it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.05,0:09:48.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, I am going to take it to an e-waste recycling center.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.95,0:09:52.43,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully some parts of this thing is salvageable.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.43,0:09:54.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And let's not waste parts.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.95,0:09:57.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,All because something is flaking.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.40,0:09:59.83,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,There are clearly parts that are still functional.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.83,0:10:05.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And I hope Apple did not serialize or block anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.95,0:10:05.62,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an8}I don't think so.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.62,0:10:07.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,If one were to mix and match parts
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.80,0:10:10.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,in this particular era of the MacBook.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.50,0:10:13.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And hopefully, maybe just swap out the batteries.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.70,0:10:16.18,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe put it on another gig of RAM or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.18,0:10:20.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure if RAMs are addable into this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.37,0:10:20.12,Default Arial/Roboto (Original),,0,0,0,,{\an8}It's soldered, so it's only possible by swapping\Nthe chip.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.12,0:10:22.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But if it's possible, then great for them.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.98,0:10:24.40,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That might be able to be used
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.40,0:10:26.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,as like some sort of thin client.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.22,0:10:28.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Or just a simple word processor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.45,0:10:29.22,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.22,0:10:32.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It could be pretty good for a very general purpose laptop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.07,0:10:34.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,However, the one thing I will always remember
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.80,0:10:40.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,is the fact that this thing was alive for 15 years.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.12,0:10:43.48,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And the fact that it lasted this crazy long. This durability.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.48,0:10:47.20,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, without accounting for battery in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:49.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Because I've been using it plugged in for a very long time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.97,0:10:52.95,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, if you don't consider battery in mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.95,0:10:55.60,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,15 years is actually surprisingly long.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.60,0:10:58.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And I say kudos to olden days Apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.75,0:11:03.27,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,For actually making a very reliable and durable product
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.27,0:11:06.12,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,that lasted this crazy long.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.12,0:11:07.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.75,0:11:10.88,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,It's a bit hard to say goodbye to this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.88,0:11:11.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Ahh...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.80,0:11:13.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Man, I'm actually going to tear up. What the fuck?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.97,0:11:15.78,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hehehe. Umm...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.78,0:11:17.63,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I really don't know what to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.63,0:11:19.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But I really need to get rid of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.58,0:11:23.52,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Because it's been flaking a lot of flakes of aluminum.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.52,0:11:26.02,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And I don't really use them anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.02,0:11:29.13,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Because it can barely run programs that we use today.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.13,0:11:31.80,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, I genuinely don't see a reason to keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.80,0:11:34.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But it also feels a little heartbreaking to let go of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.82,0:11:37.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But hopefully this goes to someone in need.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.50,0:11:39.77,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,When I send it off to recycling.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.77,0:11:41.57,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Hopefully they might pick some parts
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.57,0:11:43.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,and actually put it somewhere else.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.45,0:11:45.32,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,That actually might work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.32,0:11:47.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And actually give it to someone in need.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.00,0:11:48.05,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,We'll see about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.05,0:11:50.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not really too sure what they're going to do about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.38,0:11:51.98,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,But they say they're taking it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.98,0:11:53.38,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, I guess that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.38,0:11:54.50,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Well, that's it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.50,0:11:57.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so so so so much for listening
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.00,0:12:01.00,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,to my crazy old story about this MacBook.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.00,0:12:03.65,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And I've got another one for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.65,0:12:05.75,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,So, do check out the videos tab
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.75,0:12:07.37,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,on my channel for more of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.37,0:12:09.45,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,And that's it, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.45,0:12:11.35,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Otsu-Melo deshita. (It's been ya girl Mel)
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.35,0:12:12.70,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,Have a good night, y'all.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.70,0:12:14.07,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,See ya~!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.07,0:12:15.97,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,If it's morning, then good morning, I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.97,0:12:17.58,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,{\an5\ytshake\pos(1480,590)}Hehaha~
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.58,0:12:18.28,Mel Default,,0,0,0,,DOIYAH!
